  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tchintabaraden Pastoral Wells Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to construct six new wells and rehabilitate one important existing pastoral well in the TchintabaradenDepartment. When completed; these wells will supply drinking water to 1;250 families comprising some 5670 low-income pastoralists and their livestock.</narrative>
  </description>
